---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>wc-avatar-group</code> shows <code>wc-avatar</code> elements overlapping, each separated
  from the next by a ring in the surface color. It is a group named "Members" by default; set
  <code>label</code> for a better name.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-avatar-group label='Project members'>
    <wc-avatar name='Ada Lovelace' src='https://peacock.redvars.com/assets/img/avatar.xs.webp'></wc-avatar>
    <wc-avatar name='Grace Hopper'></wc-avatar>
    <wc-avatar name='Alan Turing'></wc-avatar>
  </wc-avatar-group>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3>Showing a few</h3>
<p>
  With <code>max</code>, the group shows that many avatars and then a <em>+N</em> button named
  "N more". Pressing it opens a popover that lists the hidden avatars by name.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-avatar-group max='3'>
    <wc-avatar name='Ada Lovelace'></wc-avatar>
    <wc-avatar name='Grace Hopper'></wc-avatar>
    <wc-avatar name='Alan Turing'></wc-avatar>
    <wc-avatar name='Katherine Johnson'></wc-avatar>
    <wc-avatar name='Edsger Dijkstra'></wc-avatar>
    <wc-avatar name='Barbara Liskov'></wc-avatar>
  </wc-avatar-group>
</DemoComponentCard>
